Subject: [PATCH] Add Platform Console (master admin portal) UI + tenant user
 endpoints

- PlatformConsole: workspace list/search, create modal, detail panel with usage,
  plan change, user list + invite (password-setup link), suspend/reactivate
- API: GET/POST /api/tenants/:id/users (platform admin only)
- Harden PATCH /api/tenants/:id: workspace admins can edit profile fields only;
  plan/status/limits are platform-admin only. POST no longer overwrites an
  existing workspace id (409)
- App: replaces the platform-admin placeholder with the console

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
